# promise: #600
# A tab's right-click menu is Arc 1.173.1's, read live 19 Nov 2026 (Victor: menus 1:1 with Arc): Copy Link,
# Share ▸ | Change Icon…, Rename…, Mute (dimmed while silent), Customize Page… on the open tab, Edit Pinned
# Page ▸ on a pinned one (Cra lists it flat after Rename…: #76, pinned-url-rows) | Add Split View on the open tab, Open in Split View on another, Duplicate, Move to ▸
# (spaces, ✓ on its own, New Space…) | Remove Pin on a pinned tab; on Today Archive Tab with Archive Other Tabs
# under ⌥, and Archive Tabs Below with Archive Tabs Above under ⌥, dimmed when there is nothing to archive.
# One row Arc doesn't have: Cast… after Mute on a web page (Victor, 22 Nov 2026; tab-menu-cast).
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}

cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=pin
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://action/pinTab
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=a
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=b
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=c
wait 1

# Listed: the pinned tab, then Today's c (open), b, a.
cra://debug?tabMenu=1&label=pinned
expect-log tab menu pinned: Copy Link\|Share ▸\|──\|Change Icon…\|Rename…\|Edit Pinned URL…\|Replace Pinned URL with Current \(off\)\|Mute \(off\)\|Cast…\|──\|Open in Split View\|Duplicate\|Move to ▸\|──\|Remove Pin$
expect-log tab menu pinned Move to: .*Personal\|──\|New Space…$
cra://debug?tabMenu=2&label=open
expect-log tab menu open: Copy Link\|Share ▸\|──\|Change Icon…\|Rename…\|Mute \(off\)\|Cast…\|Customize Page…\|──\|Add Split View\|Duplicate\|Move to ▸\|──\|Archive Tab\|Archive Other Tabs ⌥\|Archive Tabs Below\|Archive Tabs Above \(off\) ⌥$
cra://debug?tabMenu=4&label=last
expect-log tab menu last: .*\|Archive Tab\|Archive Other Tabs ⌥\|Archive Tabs Below \(off\)\|Archive Tabs Above ⌥$

# The rows do what Arc's do: Duplicate copies b right after it in the background, Archive Other Tabs
# leaves only a in Today, Remove Pin archives the pinned tab.
cra://debug?tabMenu=3&label=dup&run=Duplicate
expect-log tab menu dup ran Duplicate: pinned: n=pin today: n=c n=b n=b n=a open: n=c$
cra://debug?tabMenu=5&label=others&run=Archive Other Tabs
expect-log tab menu others ran Archive Other Tabs: pinned: n=pin today: n=a open: \S+$
cra://debug?tabMenu=1&label=unpin&run=Remove Pin
expect-log tab menu unpin ran Remove Pin: pinned: +today: n=a open: \S+$
